/**
 * #220 (R1): the mandate-blind chunk retrieval contract, per plan section 3
 * (docs/research/feed-retrieval-slice2a-plan-2026-07-11.html). `retrieve` is
 * the single search interface the future pipeline agent calls: a plain query
 * in, ranked chunk hits with full text out, in one call.
 *
 * #222 (R2) added weighted ranking behind `feed/config/retrieval-ranking.json`
